;pylm
; Font styles:
;    0: TDecorate(count=1550, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    1: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=なかじまちょうじ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=おび, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=1646, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=1555, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\選挙カー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Townspeople, thank you for stopping to listen in this heat today.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My name is <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="なかじまちょうじ">Choji Nakajima</STYLE>, and I am a candidate in next month's mayoral election.<PG>
I have already had the honor of serving as mayor for 5 terms, 20 years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All this time, I have thought about how to make Motoki-cho grow, 
{PAUSE ""}
how to make all of you townspeople more prosperous, 
{PAUSE ""}
and that is where I have focused my efforts.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As a result, our population has grown about 8 times compared to 20 years ago, and our aging rate, at about 13%, has reached the lowest level in Japan.<PG>
Talented people gather in Motoki-cho from other cities, towns and villages, and from other prefectures, and it is a municipality achieving rapid growth in every respect: economic growth, better welfare, regional revitalization and more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Nevertheless, I will not be content with that. Dreaming of making Motoki-cho the most livable place in Japan, setting that as my goal, and then making it a reality: that is what I intend to achieve in my next term.<PG>
But looking back, 2 months ago a tragic incident occurred here in Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was an incident shocking enough to be reported sensationally all over Japan, and it was the moment Motoki-cho's myth of safety and security utterly collapsed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Until then, Motoki-cho had been a municipality with one of the lowest crime rates in the country.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Resting on that, we were lax in our approach to security―
{PAUSE ""}
that is, to 'a safe life.' That is what I most need to reflect on.<PG>
When the population increases, the number of crimes inevitably increases.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When a major incident occurs, unease inevitably lingers among the residents.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If this problem is left alone, making this the best town in Japan will be utterly out of reach.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Here and now, I put forward three pledges.<PG>
One―I will develop Motoki-cho further and make it the municipality with the highest incomes in Japan.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By granting subsidies to companies that place their head offices in Motoki-cho and bringing about further regional revitalization, I will raise your incomes even further.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This will also make it possible to promote a policy under which major corporations place the head offices of their group companies in Motoki-cho, and to gather a part of Japan's economy here.<PG>
Two―I will further strengthen Motoki-cho's tourism policy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As you know, Motoki-cho is blessed with wonderful cherry blossoms.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In recent years their economic effect has been tremendous, and they are now an essential resource Motoki-cho cannot do without.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Along with branding Motoki-cho's cherry blossoms, I aim to make use of this basin's terrain to build a town that many tourists will love in summer, fall and winter as well.<PG>
The funds for the subsidies in my first pledge will be drawn from this tourism revenue and put to use for Motoki-cho's further development.<PG>
Three―I will make Motoki-cho a safe and secure town.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As I said a moment ago, the myth of Motoki-cho's safety has collapsed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There may also be townspeople who fear that population growth and expanded tourism will rob them of a safe life.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
During my term, I will install 1,000 security cameras in the town and see to swift resolution of incidents and thorough crime deterrence.<PG>
In addition, to prevent the psychology that makes crime more likely in run-down places―
{PAUSE ""}
the so-called broken-windows theory, I will set up a committee to mend the places where the town is fraying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So once I am reelected mayor, you will no longer need to worry about living in <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="おび">fear</STYLE> of violent crime.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Working with the Sawa Prefectural Police, I will make Motoki-cho an even safer town than before.<PG>
Over the years, I have made many pledges.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I take pride in having fulfilled every one of them and contributed to Motoki-cho's development.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So the three pledges I just named―
{PAUSE ""}
these, too, will be achieved in the next term, within 4 years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Higher incomes for you, expanded tourism, and a safe and secure life.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If you reelect me as mayor, these will certainly be yours within 4 years.<PG>
Please, townspeople of Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Give me the chance of 4 more years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is a chance for me, for all of you, and for Motoki-cho to grow great, like the goshinboku in Central Park.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thank you for listening in this heat.<BR>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\SE\clapping_short2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------